@rooms.sigil from Rooms import { room, room owner }
@booking.sigil from Booking import { renter, booking request }

component Identity {
  goal {
    Let a person hold one *user* account and act in Slotted only through an
    authenticated *session*.
  }

  state {
    Each user has one account type; being a room owner or a renter comes from
    the user's relationship to a room or booking request, not from the user
    record.
  }

  logic {
    The session gate reads the session from the request, resolves it to a user,
    and returns that user as the actor or stops with an unauthenticated refusal.
  }

  constraints {
    Every page and every mutation except sign-up, sign-in and the
    authentication handler must pass the session gate before it reads or
    changes data.

    A redirect based only on the presence of a session cookie must not be
    treated as the session gate.

    Commands and queries in other components must receive the actor explicitly
    and must not read the session themselves.

    Identity builds the session on Better Auth 1.7 with email and password
    sign-in, backed by the Drizzle adapter.
  }

  cases {
    A request with no session reaches the session gate; it is refused and
    nothing changes.

    A request whose session cookie was forged passes the cookie redirect but is
    refused by the session gate.
  }

  interface {
    A visitor can sign up with email and password to create a user, then sign
    in to start a session and sign out to end it.

    Identity provides the *actor*, the user resolved from a valid session for
    the current request.

    Identity provides the *session gate*, which returns the actor for a request
    or refuses it as unauthenticated when no valid session exists.
  }

  decisions {
    Passing the actor explicitly keeps the session gate the single place where
    a session becomes a user, and keeps commands testable outside a request.

    Better Auth was chosen for the session because Auth.js receives security
    fixes only and Lucia is deprecated; magic-link sign-in was deferred because
    it needs email delivery.
  }
}
